 "$comment": "The application catalog (crates/core/packages, docs/app-packages.md). Every application a world may install, what it imitates, how it runs, and what each platform calls it. A package's qualified id is `<id>-<version>-<platform>-<device>`, each suffix ignorable: `kicad-8.0-ubuntu-desktop` and `kicad` name the same package. `products` are the professional applications (the engineering and media-production suites) sold once per organization through the hosted API (docs/app-packages.md § Professional applications); a package names its product in `product`, and every package of a product is unlocked by one purchase. The other closed applications (the office suite, Visual Studio Code, Music, Maps) are hosted-only and come with every plan.",
